{
  "tema": 6307,
  "slug": "gerundio-modo",
  "titulo": "Using the gerund to say by doing something",
  "subtitulo": "Aprendo repitiendo: the gerund says how, with no preposition.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "To say by + -ing, use the gerund alone (-ando, -iendo), with no preposition: aprendo repitiendo, never por repitiendo.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say how you achieve something, _by doing_ something, Spanish uses the **gerund** (**-ando**, **-iendo**) on its own."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "main action",
            "gerund (how)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "There's **no preposition** before the gerund, unlike English _by_: **se pierde peso comiendo bien**, not **por comiendo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the gerund is the tool in your hand; it doesn't need a handle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Memorizo la información ==repitiendo== mucho.",
              "en": "I memorize information by repeating it a lot."
            },
            {
              "es": "Marta controlaba el estrés ==haciendo== ejercicio.",
              "en": "Marta managed her stress by exercising."
            },
            {
              "es": "Aprendimos mucho ==escribiendo== en el pizarrón.",
              "en": "We learned a lot by writing on the board."
            },
            {
              "es": "Las cosas se logran ==teniendo== paciencia.",
              "en": "Things are achieved by being patient."
            },
            {
              "es": "Se mejora en jiu-jitsu ==rolando== todos los días.",
              "en": "You get better at jiu-jitsu by rolling every day."
            },
            {
              "es": "Abrí el carro ==usando== una cuña.",
              "en": "I opened the car by using a wedge."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
